h food</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:27\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,27)\">1Kgs 20:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> proposes <bdbheb>בַּגִּלְבֹּעַ</bdbheb>). <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יָכִיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,26)\">1Kgs 7:26</ref> + 2 t. etc.; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הָכִיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,11)\">Jer 6:11</ref> + 5 t.; — <highlight>contain, hold, hold in, endure</highlight>; </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>contain</highlight>, followed by accusative (of liquid) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,26)\">1Kgs 7:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:38\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,38)\">1Kgs 7:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,5)\">2Chr 4:5</ref> in figure <ref ref=\"Jer 2:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,13)\">Jer 2:13</ref>, absolute <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:32\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,32)\">Ezek 23:32</ref> (of burnt-offering) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:64\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"64\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"64\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,64)\">1Kgs 8:64</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 7:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,7)\">2Chr 7:7</ref> <highlight>hold in</highlight> (wrath of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, object not expressed, subject Jeremiah) <ref ref=\"Jer 6:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,11)\">Jer 6:11</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>שָׁפַךְ</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"po